triage: fix_game: The rules say TAKE is offered to every seat whenever current_card is not 0. In three separate scenarios the game never offered TAKE to the seat in question, including a 0-chip seat whose only legal option is TAKE. So the offer steps in the file are mis-built; the tests and rules are not the problem.
